Package: bitcoin-core
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Bitcoin Core server binaries
 Bitcoin Core, built from the upstream release tag with no local patches.
 .
 Contains the server components only: bitcoind, bitcoin-cli and
 bitcoin-util. The GUI and the test binaries are not built.
 .
 Built from source by DWDC for testing and development. The signature on
 this package attests that DWDC built it from the named upstream tag; it
 is not a reproducible build and does not attest that the binaries match
 those published by the Bitcoin Core project.
